#: bot/services/netflix.py:155
msgid "Netflix titles cannot be downloaded."
msgstr "لا يمكن تنزيل عناوين Netflix."

#: bot/services/podcasts.py:461
msgid ""
"Podcasts have their own commands. Send h to see pc, pcd, pe, pd, pa, ps "
"and pu."
msgstr "للبودكاست أوامره الخاصة. أرسل h لعرض pc وpcd وpe وpd وpa وps وpu."

